"""Interactive current-to-expanded cylinder collision review."""
import json
from build import OUT

def main():
    r=json.loads((OUT/'verification.json').read_text());render=json.loads((OUT/'renders.json').read_text());views={}
    for row in render['views']:views.setdefault(row['scope'],{}).setdefault(row['camera'],{})[row['stage']]=row['path']
    details={}
    for row in r['trials']:
        key={30:'motor-1',37:'motor-2',17:'main-tube',26:'second-tube'}[row['node']]
        details[key]=dict(before=row['previous_triangles'],after=row['diagnostic_triangles'],side=row['exposed_round_sides_to_original']['max_mm'],outside=row['source_outside_native_union']['max_mm'])
    html='''<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><style>
body{font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui);color:var(--foreground);line-height:1.45}p{margin:0 0 12px}.muted,small{color:var(--muted-foreground)}.controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:14px 0}select{font:inherit;color:var(--foreground);background:var(--background);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;padding:8px;max-width:100%}.pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.caption{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:5px}.imagebox{aspect-ratio:1;background:#c3d2e0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}.imagebox img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px;margin:14px 0}td,th{text-align:left;padding:8px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.note{padding:16px;margin:14px 0;background:var(--secondary);border-radius:var(--radius,10px)}.note p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}small{font-size:12px}
</style></head><body>
<p><strong>Both remaining motor housings and both tubes now have cylinder compounds.</strong> The approved visual file stays byte-identical.</p>
<div class="controls"><select id="reference" aria-label="Comparison reference"><option value="current">Previous arm collision</option><option value="installed">Original installed collision</option><option value="visual">Approved visual appearance</option></select><select id="scope" aria-label="Scope"><option value="arm">Complete arm</option><option value="whole-core">Whole Core</option><option value="motor-1">First motor housing</option><option value="motor-2">Second motor housing</option><option value="main-tube">Main flanged tube</option><option value="second-tube">Second tube</option></select><select id="camera" aria-label="Camera"><option value="oblique">Oblique</option><option value="reverse">Reverse</option></select></div>
<div class="pair"><div><p class="caption" id="beforeLabel"></p><div class="imagebox"><img id="before" alt="Reference arm"></div></div><div><p class="caption">Expanded collision candidate</p><div class="imagebox"><img id="after" alt="Expanded arm cylinder colliders"></div></div></div>
<p id="detail" class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:9px"></p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Across both Cores</th><th>Previous arm pass</th><th>Expanded pass</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Native representation</td><td>21,410 mesh triangles + 18 cylinders</td><td>13,218 mesh triangles + 42 cylinders</td></tr><tr><td>Collision mesh diagnostic</td><td>23,138 triangles</td><td>17,250 triangles</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p><strong>71.4% fewer arm mesh triangles than the installed reference</strong>, with 42 native cylinders across the two Cores. This adds 8,192 mesh-triangle savings over the previous native arm pass.</p>
<div class="note"><p><strong>Overlapping cylinders are supported.</strong> Each new part uses three overlapping cylinders; interior intersection witnesses confirm that its compound is connected. Every source part keeps its own owner and transform.</p><p>Tube bores and motor side openings are deliberately filled in collision. Motor collars use flat crowns and the tube flares use small steps. Round-side sampled changes reach 6.91 mm on a motor collar and 3.58 mm on a tube. New source points outside the cylinder solids reach 2.20 mm.</p></div>
<p class="muted"><small>Blue identifies the four newly replaced collision owners; grey is retained collision, including the first arm pass. Circles are rendered with 24 segments for inspection; native physics retains analytic round cylinders. Side-profile figures exclude newly filled cap interiors, whose distances from the former hollow surfaces can reach 66.35 mm. Contact, all-pose clearance and speedups remain untested; nothing installed or committed.</small></p>
<p class="muted"><small>Whole-field review stage: 344,792 visual triangles unchanged; collision is either 483,325 diagnostic mesh triangles or 479,293 mesh triangles + 42 native cylinders. These alternatives are counted separately. Other reviewed assets stay as before.</small></p>
<script>const data=__DATA__,el=id=>document.getElementById(id);function show(){let s=el('scope').value,c=el('camera').value,r=el('reference').value,v=data.views[s][c];el('before').src=v[r];el('after').src=v.expanded;el('beforeLabel').textContent=el('reference').selectedOptions[0].textContent;let d=data.details[s];el('detail').textContent=d?`Per Core: ${d.before.toLocaleString()} previous mesh triangles → 3 native cylinders (${d.after} diagnostic triangles). Sampled side change ${d.side.toFixed(2)} mm; source outside solid ${d.outside.toFixed(2)} mm.`:'New changes: the two long tubes and both remaining motor housings. Select a close-up to inspect the filled openings and stepped collars.';}['reference','scope','camera'].forEach(id=>el(id).onchange=show);show();console.log('Expanded arm comparison: 48 verified matched images');</script>
</body></html>'''
    (OUT/'gallery.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(dict(views=views,details=details))))

if __name__=='__main__':main()
